    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.08
  m_Text: 'You are Nour. The school is dark, the demolition crew comes at dawn, and
    the Shadow hunts in the dark.


    <b>Move</b>  W A S D        <b>Look</b> 
    mouse

    <b>Sprint</b>  hold Left Shift    <b>Crouch</b>  hold Left Ctrl

    <b>Flashlight</b> 
    F            <b>Interact</b>  E

    <b>Answer</b>  1 2 3 4          <b>Objectives</b> 
    Tab      <b>Pause</b>  Esc


    Answer chalkboard questions to charge the <b>Bright
    Idea Meter</b>. A brighter beam reaches further, repels the Shadow above 30,
    and keeps the dark away. Wrong answers and timeouts dim it.


    Lit rooms are
    safe: the Shadow cannot enter them, and every lit room is a checkpoint. The battery
    is fuel and runs out; batteries are scattered through the school.


    Restore
    <b>three fuse boxes</b>, collect <b>six Knowledge Fragments</b>, power the gate,
    and walk out. You cannot die - being caught only costs light and sends you back
    to the last checkpoint.'
